summary:
  Whether a reopen gained anything is asked of the position the player gave.

history:
  A reopen that lands on the same unfinished end has gained nothing, and the
  buffer is left for the broadcast. Judged by the header's length every end
  looks five minutes past the last reopen, and a writer that stands would
  have the file reopened without end.

target:
  package/contents/ui/TimeshiftEngine.qml

find:
          var stalled = _lastReopenPosMs >= 0 && place - _lastReopenPosMs < 500;

replace:
          var stalled = _lastReopenPosMs >= 0 && posMs - _lastReopenPosMs < 500;

expect:
  Killed by tst_timeshiftengine::test_a_reopen_that_gains_nothing_on_such_a_file_gives_up.
  Line-neutral.
